          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "HEB.11.31"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ilh 11.31",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JAS.2.25"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yko 2.25",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Neirriwaa Yoshua olayioni le Nuni te nkisudoroto iltung'ana oare te Shitumu metaa ilaikitalak, ejo, “Enchom, eng'ura enkop, neisul Yeriko.” Nepuo ninche, nepuonu enkaji e mulayoi apa naji enkarna enye Rahabu, neirrag ninche ine. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Netolikioki apa olaiguanani le Yeriko aajoki, “Ng'ura, etii kulikae tung'ana le Israel ooetuo ene duoo kewarie pee ejur enkop.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neirriwaa ilo aiguanani le Yeriko iltung'ana enkaji e Rahabu, ejo, “Ntayu lelo tung'ana ooetuo enkaji ino, lelo ootijing'a enkaji ino; amu enkop pooki eetuo ninche aajur.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kake ewa apa ina kitok lelo tung'ana pokira oare aisudoo; nejo ninye, “Esipa eetuo iltung'ana enatii nanu, kake mayiolo nanu ajo kaji eing'uaa ninche; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ore ake pee eaku keikeni kishomi, etomisimiso, neipang lelo tung'ana aapuo, ore eneshomo lelo tung'ana mayiolo nanu; entasioki entusujai ninche amu inepupu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kake eyaua apa ninye ninche enchumata e nkaji, neisudoo ninche too ndupa apa naa ninche naaitobirare te nchumata e nkaji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neaku etusujaitie iltung'ana ninche te nkoitoi nalo Yordan, o metabaiki ilang'at; nerisio ake eipang'a iltung'ana aapuo neikeni kishomi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.2.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore eton eitu eirura ninche, neilepu ninye alotu enetii ninche te nchumata e nkaji, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nejoki ninche, “Ayiolo nanu nchere eishoo Olaitoriani intae ena kop, naa ore euriata nikiure intae etijing'a iyiook, naa ore iloomanya ena kop pooki nelepori te dukuya intae. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.14.21"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ena 14.21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.21.21+NUM.21.22+NUM.21.23+NUM.21.24+NUM.21.25+NUM.21.26+NUM.21.27+NUM.21.28+NUM.21.29+NUM.21.30+NUM.21.31+NUM.21.32+NUM.21.33+NUM.21.34+NUM.21.35"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Enki 21.21-35",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Amu kitoning'oitie iyiook ina naitoyio Olaitoriani nkariak e Naiposha Nanyokie te dukuya intae ina kata pee impang'ung'u aapuku te Misiri, o ina nintaasa lelo aiguanak loo Lamori apa ootii lido kekun le Yordan, o Sihon o Oog, apa lindaikie ninche katukul. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore ake pee kining ina, nikilepori, nemeetae empijan natelekua te likae lee hoo obo, te nkaraki intae; amu Olaitoriani Enkai inyi ninye ilo ora Enkai te shumata o ti abori te nkop. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore naa taata, enosakaki olmumai to Laitoriani nchere ore anaa enaitaasa nanu intae te supatisho, naa eikintaasiasa sii intae te supatisho o enkaji e papa nikinchosho nanu olmonekie osipa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nintajeuu pee meye papa o yieyio, o lalashera laainei o nkanashera, o lelo pooki oora ilkulenye, nikordudu enkishui ang aaitung'uaa keeya.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejoki lelo tung'ana ninye, “Enkishui ang te rishata e nkishui inyi, te neaku eitu ilikio kuna baa ang, nikitum taa aaitaasa iyie te supatisho o te nkisiligata te neisho iyiook Olaitoriani ena kop.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.2.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neitadoyio ninye ninche te nkeene aimie elusie, amu ore apa enkaji enye naa esuntai e nkanasa apa eshetakino. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejoki ninye ninche, “Enchom ildoinyo, meinepu ake intae lelo oosujita intae; nisudoriri te ine nkolong'i uni, o metaba anaa neshukunye lelo oosujita intae, nitumutumu taa aashom aaima enkoitoi inyi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejoki lelo tung'ana ninye, “Mikiyieu iyiook nikiaata eleyiata ti alo ele mumai linosie iyiook. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.2.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 2:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ura, ti nikipuonu akenya aarasaki ena kop, teeniki enkarasha nanyokie ele dirisha liimie iyiook; nisot ti atua enkaji ino papaai lino o yieyioo lino, o lalashera linono o lelo pooki le nkaji e papaai lino. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.2.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 2:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Te neipang oltung'ani boo aim kutuk aji e nkaji ino nelo enkoitoi, ore osarge lenye neaku shumata endukuya enye etii, nimikintoki iyiook aata eleyiata; kake te neiteleikini enkaina aar oltung'ani ake ninye otii te nebo iyie ti atua aji, neaku osarge lenye shumata lukuny ang etii. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.2.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.2.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 2:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kake ti nilikio kuna baa ang, nimikintoki iyiook aata eleyiata ti alo ele mumai linosie iyie iyiook.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.2.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 2:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejo ninye, “Anaa enitejo intae, nchoo etiu neijia.” Neisho ninche meshomo, nepuo ninche, neeniki ninye enkarasha nanyokie oldirisha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.2.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.2.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 2:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.2.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.2.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 2:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nepuo ninche aajing ildoinyo, netoni te ine nkolong'i uni, o metaba anaa neshukunye lelo apa oosujita ninche; amu eing'orutua apa lelo oosujita ninche; te nkoitoi pooki neitu etum toki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.2.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.2.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 2:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neitoki lelo tung'ana pokira oare aadou too ldoinyo, nelang olkeju, nepuo enetii Yoshua olayioni le Nuni; neliki ninye nena pooki naatupukokitio ninche. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.2.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.2.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 2:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejoki ninche Yoshua, “Esipa eishorua Olaitoriani enkop pooki apik inkaik ang; netalepori sii lelo pooki oomanya ina kop te nkaraki iyiook.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.2.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.2.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
